  <data name="About_Disclaimer" xml:space="preserve"><value>Use It Before only reminds you about dates that you or the pack provide. It does not give medical or food-safety advice. Always follow the label and your doctor or pharmacist.</value></data>
  <data name="About_Privacy" xml:space="preserve"><value>Your list stays on this phone. Photos are read on the phone. A small copy of each product photo is kept inside the app (not in your gallery) and deleted with the item. When a photo shows a barcode, only the barcode number is sent to Open Food Facts to find the product name. If you share a home with family, its list (not photos) goes through the free ntfy.sh relay, encrypted so only your family&apos;s phones can read it. The app contacts GitHub on Wi-Fi to check for updates.</value></data>
